      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1905-09-02_WidnesExaminer_art0096" n="art0096">
        <head>HE MADE A MISTAKE.</head>
        <p>HE MADE A MISTAKE.</p>
        <p>_ "Madam, I am soliciting for home charities. We have hundreds of poor, ragged, v„icions children like those at your gate, and- " Sir, those children are mine," and the slam- ming of the door could be heard in the nes.t street.</p>
        <p>A lady mado a complaint to Frederick this Great King.. of Prussia. "Your. Majesty," said she, ray husband treats me badly." " That's flout of my business," said the king. "Bull he speaks ill of, you," said the lady. " That, said bal hoe of your business."</p>
